      "text_helper": "Section 31.6.4 \"Cortex®-M3 JEDEC-106 ID code\" in chapter 31 (Debug support (DBG)), RM0008 Rev 21, page 1088.",
      "section_content": "The Arm® Cortex®-M3 integrates a JEDEC-106 ID code. It is located in the 4KB ROM table\nmapped on the internal PPB bus at address 0xE00FF000_0xE00FFFFF.\nThis code is accessible by the JTAG Debug Port (4 to 5 pins) or by the SW Debug Port (two\npins) or by the user software.",
